      },
      "review_rationale": "AI-assisted implementation-author review after known Round 6 development findings; not independent expert validation. Reread original HHS Chapter 7 printed pages 88/90/91 from lawful stored PDF, checking exact bytes, locators and prose. Preserve relative increase versus usual activity and injury risk, relative light/moderate start, duration/frequency before optional intensity, adaptation/recovery and individualization. Numerical examples are not activated as a universal progression threshold or a personal pain/running prescription. Original independent and first development results remain unchanged."
    }
